# promise: #716
# With Settings ▸ Advanced "Only this space’s tabs" on, ⌘T leaves out another space's pinned tabs too,
# not only its open Today tabs: a pinned tab in Work never comes up from Home, so Return can't take the
# window to Work. Off (the default since #307, Victor's call: Arc's bar finds a tab in any space) lists it.
